# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Signing
#
# The release key is NOT in this repo. It lives in CI as a repository secret
# and is restored at build time; see RELEASING.md.
#
# The signing certificate is embedded in every published APK, so a key that sits
# in a public repo is a key anyone can use to sign an update. The key that was
# committed here was rotated when the repo went public.
keystore/
keystore.properties

# Push notifications
#
# google-services.json identifies a Firebase project and is not meant to be
# shared; it is per-project configuration, not source. The build skips the
# google-services plugin when it is absent, so a fresh checkout still compiles.
app/google-services.json
#
# The FCM token this device reported to the server, written by the app through
# /api/experimental/fs/write. It is a live push credential for one phone.
.opencode/push-device.json
#
# A Firebase service-account private key, if one is ever placed in the tree for
# testing. It can send push to every device in the project.
*-service-account.json

# Tools
#
# The theme generator in tools/theme-gen is committed, because the generated
# colour schemes are only reproducible if the thing that produced them is too.
# Its dependencies are not.
tools/theme-gen/node_modules/
